Progressive Delivery with Argo Rollouts
Lab Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

Understand the concepts of progressive delivery and its benefits
Install and configure Argo Rollouts on a Kubernetes cluster
Implement canary deployment strategies using Argo Rollouts
Deploy applications using blue/green deployment strategy
Monitor and control progressive deployments
Rollback deployments when issues are detected
Prerequisites
Before starting this lab, you should have:

Basic understanding of Kubernetes concepts (pods, services, deployments)
Familiarity with YAML configuration files
Basic knowledge of container technologies
Understanding of deployment strategies concepts
Experience with command-line interface operations
